---
title: "set_data_sources::execute (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse: DataSources { sources } = from_byte_vec(payload)
    q_parse --> q_cursor: cursor = cursor::new(bytes)
    q_cursor --> q_count: data_sources_count = deserialize_u8(cursor)
    q_count --> q_loop: i = 0, sources = []
    q_loop --> q_check: i < data_sources_count
    q_check --> q_deser: true
    q_check --> q_destroy: false
    q_deser --> q_build: chain_id = deserialize_u16, address = deserialize_vector(32)
    q_build --> q_push: push_back(sources, data_source::new(chain_id, ext_addr))
    q_push --> q_loop: i = i + 1
    q_destroy --> q_set: cursor::destroy_empty(cursor)
    q_set --> q_empty: state::set_data_sources empties existing registry
    q_empty --> q_add_loop: add all new sources to registry
    q_add_loop --> [*]: return

    note right of q_set
        INV-001: existing data sources are completely replaced (not appended)
        INV-002: cursor must be fully consumed
        INV-003: requires LatestOnly capability
    end note
